* ''The ceremony's answer kinds'' (operator, 2026-11-06, approving the house's defaults). The clean ceremony document hosts a passphrase answer (custody and ward) and a WebAuthn PRF answer (custody only); the ward refuses a passkey, and a PRF slot never stands as the sole copy. PRF only wraps a custody key: it never authenticates and never gates an act (the 2026-11-04 ruling "never a passkey": no WebAuthn registry gates any act). Carrier: `pono/browser-vessel-lift#/the-ceremony`, carried by the b1 lanes' carriers at their land.

